	(text "FXOSC (DEC-015): Y401 16 MHz, CL 8 pF, +/-10 ppm; C424/C425 10 pF C0G, R408 0R (RsEXT), as NXP FRDM-A-S32K344.\n  gm_crit = 0.28 mA/V vs GM 9.7 mA/V min; tune C and RsEXT on the first boards (HDG E2 3.1).\nLAYOUT: Y401, C424, C425, R408 next to K1/L1, no vias, clean GND under them, cap grounds together (HDG E2 3.2).\nVREFL ties to VSS. V11 and V25 are internal regulator outputs: decoupling only, no loads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
